  "Name": "NO_CARRYINGENTITY_PACK",
  "Description": "NO_CARRYINGENTITY_PACK\n\nThis is a simple process that allows you to use the packing process without having to specify a carrying entity to pack into. This useful as a checking process where they do not physically pack boxes or not box labels are used.\n\nThe way this is achieved is by inserting the document number into to output table as the carrying entity barcode. This process can be used in conjunction with ORDER_PACK_REVERSAL with setup modifications.",
